      "text": "Full Courses: \n- 1 NeetCode DSA Course (Specific) (+TC + STL + C++)\n- 2 NeetCode 75\n- 3 InterviewBitCoreCS\n- 4 FullStack WebDevJS TheOdinProject\n\n\n75 Aftermath: \n- Resume & Github & Linkedin update\n- 5 NeetCode 150\n- 6 Udemy FullStack GenAI ChaiAurCode\n\n150 Aftermath:\n- Resume & Github & Linkedin update\n- 7 NeetCode 250\n- 8 CoreCS 60hrs\n\n250 Aftermath:\n- Resume & Github & Linkedin update\n- NeetCode Life \n- Udemy FullStack WebDev ChaiAurCode\n- Udemy DSA AbdulBari\n- 100xdev Web3\n- 100xdev WebDevAdv\n- 100xdev DevOps\n- CP31 800 900 1000 1100 1200 1300 1400 1500\n- CPHB\n- FullStack WebDevROR TheOdinProject\n- Hacking Book\n\n\n\n",
